  "notes": "USAGE:\nThe transitive counterpart of ⟦{泊|と}まる→泊まる：10445_tomaru⟧ (to stay overnight). The subject is the person providing the lodging, and the person staying is marked with ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧: ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{泊|と}める.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n⟦{止|と}める→止める：00678_tomeru⟧ means \"to stop\" and ⟦{留|と}める→留める：10053_tomeru⟧ means \"to fasten/pin.\" All three are read とめる but use different kanji.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{友人|ゆうじん}→友人：03649_yuujin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{泊|と}める: to put up a friend\n- ⟦{家|いえ}→家：00612_ie⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{泊|と}める: to let stay at one's house\n- ⟦{一晩|ひとばん}→一晩：08887_hitoban⟧{泊|と}める: to let stay for one night",
